  /// event the audit listener has already recorded. Without this column there
  /// is no way to tell that replay from a genuine second event, and the log
  /// silently accumulates duplicates.
  ///
  /// Nullable because events published outside the outbox — and every row
  /// written before this column existed — carry no guarantee of one.
  eventId         String?   @unique

  eventName       String
  action          String
  module          String

  aggregateType   String
  aggregateId     String

  userId          String?
  userEmail       String?
